## www -> apex, over https. Its own site block, so Caddy provisions a real
## certificate for www too: a redirect served over https still has to complete
## a TLS handshake before the browser will read the 301.
## (Double '#': one is stripped by the uncomment, leaving a real Caddy comment.)
#www.mastermindx.ai {
#	header Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=300"
#	redir https://mastermindx.ai{uri} permanent
#}
#
#http://mastermindx.ai {
#	redir https://mastermindx.ai{uri} permanent
#}
